  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ed413638dc688554fb795da575df2789, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OneHealth.ShowVisualCard
  itemId: 430
  indentLevel: 0
  title: One Health
  image: {fileID: 0}
  caption: 'One Health is a way of working: use evidence, respect people, protect
    health, and coordinate across human, animal and environmental systems.'
--- !u!114 &131338922
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 131338906}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ed413638dc688554fb795da575df2789, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OneHealth.ShowVisualCard
  itemId: 429
  indentLevel: 0
  title: "Debrief \u2014 Adaptation"
  image: {fileID: 0}
  caption: When conditions changed, you revised the plan while protecting essential
    actions.
--- !u!114 &131338923
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 131338906}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ed413638dc688554fb795da575df2789, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OneHealth.ShowVisualCard
  itemId: 428
  indentLevel: 0
  title: "Debrief \u2014 Trade-offs"
  image: {fileID: 0}
  caption: Money, Trust, Resistance Pressure, Time and Capacity represent different
    pressures. Improving one part of a response may create costs elsewhere.
--- !u!114 &131338924
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 131338906}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ed413638dc688554fb795da575df2789, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OneHealth.ShowVisualCard
  itemId: 427
  indentLevel: 0
  title: "Debrief \u2014 One Health"
  image: {fileID: 0}
  caption: Community prevention, animal-health assessment and environmental follow-up
    can support one another. No single sector can manage every risk alone.
--- !u!114 &131338925
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 131338906}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ed413638dc688554fb795da575df2789, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OneHealth.ShowVisualCard
  itemId: 426
  indentLevel: 0
  title: "Debrief \u2014 Stewardship"
  image: {fileID: 0}
  caption: Antimicrobials are essential when clinically indicated. Stewardship means
    appropriate access and use, not withholding needed treatment.
--- !u!114 &131338926
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 131338906}
